the loud house was crowned as  Nickelodeon's top show of 2016 beating  popular shows like paw Patrol Henry  danger and Nicky Ricky Dicky and Dawn  the loud house revolves around the  chaotic lives of a family with eleven  kids whose names all begin with the  letter L and their friends just wait  until the end to see if your favorite  character is part of our list don't  forget to hit that subscribe button and  give this video a thumbs up today we're  talking about ten the loud house  characters in real life Lisa let's just  jump right into it and start with the  second youngest of the loud family Lisa  is just four years old but she's not  your typical toddler despite her age she  is one of the smartest people in her  family and she already won a Nobel Prize  for her outstanding accomplishments but  although she's incredibly intelligent  Lisa still has childlike qualities she's  often sarcastic she rarely smiles when  she speaks with a cute list she wants to  become a scientist and through most of  the episodes she can be seen working on  various experiments although it seems  ridiculous for a four-year-old Lisa  loves solving difficult math problems  and she sometimes studies her siblings  bathroom habits lisa has short brown  hair big round glasses and she usually  wears a green sweater with purplish  pants  check out tumblr user lumple Stiltskin  who decided to dress up as Lisa chica  passes this nobel-prize-winning  four-year-old in real life lisa is  played by Lara Jill Miller  known for giving a voice to characters  in several cartoons including Henry  hugglemonster and Curious George  and Emmy winning cartoon did you know  that Lisa along with her other sisters  was named after the loud house directors  actual sisters he first created the  characters as rabbits with names  starting with being we're so glad he  recreated them as humans and  lissa her no-nonsense personality Lola  Lola is the third youngest child from  the loud family she's six years old and  she's what you'd call a total diva we  have a perfect celebrity that matches  Lola's look and we'll reveal who it is  in a couple of seconds but first let's  talk about Lola this six year old loves  to look at herself in a mirror she loves  anything that's girly and she can be  quite bratty like most six year olds  Lola comes with a temper and you don't  want to get on her bad side  she has long blonde hair and she usually  wears a long pink dress as she's still a  child  she's also missing her two front teeth  which only makes her look even crazier  whenever she throws a tantrum she loves  getting her way and she's by far one of  the brightest characters on the show do  you remember  Elena Thompson from here comes honey boo  boo we think she's a perfect real-life  version of Lola especially if you watch  her episodes in toddlers and tiaras  Lola's voice belongs to Grady Lyle who  you might know from playing Mandy in the  grim adventures of Billy and Mandy and  Frankie in Foster's Home for Imaginary  Friends along with having a sister named  Lola the creator of the loud house also  had a wiener dog called Lola which is  how this bratty character got her name  we can't wait to see what Lola will be  up to in the next episodes Lana next in  line is Lana loud Lola's twin Lana is  Lola's complete opposite  while Lola loves to wear dresses and put  on makeup  Lana prefers doing tomboyish things  which include playing in the mud  although physical looks are identical to  Lola's Lana has a completely different  style she often wears a red snapback and  denim overalls just like Lola she also  has two missing front teeth and long  blonde hair that's usually put in low  pigtails have you ever seen the fourth  season of MasterChef junior we think  that the nine-year-old Addison Smith  looks like a perfect version of Lana  she's often seen wearing colored  snapback and has blonde hair although we  can imagine  is nowhere near as wild as Lana we can  definitely see the resemblance with  these two Lana is also voiced by the  very talented gray de lisle who gave  Lana her iconic and slightly raspy child  voice the director of the loud house  said the inspiration for Lana's  character and all other sisters came  from his own ten siblings family  although Lana is highlighted as someone  who loves playing in the mud and getting  her hands dirty his siblings never  complained about how their characters  were portrayed Kris said it's because  they have a fantastic sense of humor  just like the characters from the loud  family Lucy  most of us have gone through a goth  phase as teenagers do you remember that  look we were all dark clothing had a  thick black eyeliner we listened to sad  music we were incredibly moody it looks  like Lucy the eight year old is also in  that phase she's just two years older  than Lola and Lana but three years  younger than Lincoln which makes her the  only one with such a big age gap you  probably noticed by now that everyone in  the family has a specific personality  that makes them stand out from the  others  Lucy is the goth child Lucy is a pale  skinned character who's always wearing  an all-black outfit her black  shoulder-length hair sports bangs almost  cover up her eyes she's mysterious she  always has a frown and she loves scaring  people  she moves silently and she's often seen  startling her family as she appears out  of nowhere she's definitely a fun  character to cosplay and low-key fan 18  from deviantART decided to show what  Lucy would look like in real life she  really nailed her character and her  bangs are absolutely perfect  Lucy's voice belongs to Jessica DeCicco  who you might know from series like  Adventure Time and DC superhero girls we  love Lucy for her unique personality  even though she doesn't play a very  excitable or a happy character she  stands out from the rest of her family  and it's why we love her Lincoln along  with Lucy the 11 year old Lincoln is the  only character in the loud  that doesn't have the typical brown or  blonde hair Lincoln is the family's  middle child but he's also the only boy  can you imagine being the only boy in a  family with ten sisters is probably why  he and Lucy are one of the quietest ones  in the family  Lincoln is slim and has unique white  hair that makes him stand out from the  rest  much like the four year old Lisa Lincoln  is the nerd of the family although he  doesn't have a Nobel Prize Lincoln is  one of those kids that loves reading  comic books and playing video games as  the only boy in the family  Lincoln is often being taken advantage  of by his sisters and has to put up with  participating in fashion shows and other  experiments you think that would make  him Rebell against his sisters but  Lincoln is a pretty quiet kid we think  that the model Paul Craddock could  easily pass as a real-life Lincoln did  you know that Lincoln is voiced by two  child actors both grant Palmer and Colin  Dean are absolutely adorable and they  did an outstanding job portraying  Lincoln Lincoln actually looks exactly  like the rabbit from the original loud  house characters all the creator had to  do was erase his triangle nose rabbit  ears and the tail  that explains why Lincoln has his white  hair Flynn let's move on to the 13 year  old Lynne loud the fifth oldest child  and one of the most competitive members  of the loud family as you can guess from  her clothing Lynne loves sports and she  always wants to be the number one she  turns everything into a competition  which as you can imagine can easily get  on her siblings nerves  if Lisa got a Nobel Prize it's safe to  say Lynne will easily compete at the  Olympics Lynne often wears an athletic  outfit and she sports brown hair tied in  a ponytail we think that Anna Romero a  Spanish football enthusiast could easily  portray Lynne in  action-movie although she'll have to  love more than just football because Lin  excels at just about any sport have you  ever wondered why her voice sounds  similar to the voice of her  eight-year-old sister her character is  voiced by Jessica DeCicco who also gives  voice to Lucy you've probably guessed by  now that Lynne is not the one that's  easily mess with as she's the most  competitive she's also the most  confrontational you wouldn't want to get  on a bad side  the creator of the show mentioned that  if he was a storyboard artist he'd  easily focus on just Lincoln and Lynn as  his two main characters but instead he's  giving everyone a chance to shine  Louanne Louanne loud is 14 years old and  she's one of our favorite members of the  loud family  she loves to joke around and she's what  we call a queen of puns although most of  her jokes usually fall flat with the  crowd we can't help but love her  slightly outrageous pranks which can  sometimes go to the next level on April  Fool she pranked the entire household by  placing traps in every corner but LuAnn  is also good at looking at the bright  side of life and seeing everything as a  positive experience and that's precisely  why we love her she usually wears a  white top with a flower on the front  collar and a yellow plated skirt she has  brown hair that's usually tied up in a  ponytail and she's also seen wearing  braces LuAnn is voiced by Christina  Pacelli who played Catwoman and Miss  Martian in DC's superhero girls and gave  her voice to several other cartoon  characters a deviantART cosplayer called  the O one angel decided to dress up as  Luanne and she managed to recreate a  pretty good real-life version of the 13  year old jokester of the loud family all  she needs now is a handful of puns some  pranks under her sleeve and a lifetime  supply of bad jokes Lennie  unfortunately we haven't got the time to  talk about the rock chick Luna so let's  just skip to the second oldest character  of the LA  family Lenny is a typical 16 year old  Lenny is known as the dizziest member of  the family she's also the most gullible  and naive and is often an easy target  for others even though she has to cope  with 10 siblings Lenny has a heart of  gold and his kind and compassionate she  has long blonde hair and is wearing a  teal colored dress with the same colored  slippers don't you think that julianne  hough looks like the perfect real-life  version of Lenny although it looks like  Lenny's the second oldest and least  intelligent person in the family she is  quite creative and loves fashion design  finally her four year old sister Lisa is  the second youngest but she's the  smartest of the bunch Lenny is voiced by  Liliana Mooney who you might know from  Howl's Moving Castle and Cheaper by the  Dozen unlike many other voice actors on  the show Liliana only voices Lenny which  is why the character can stand out from  the rest  sure you might get frustrated with Lenny  because she's so naive but you can't say  she's not an excellent addition to the  loud family it's definitely hard being a  big sister to that many siblings but no  one knows this better than the oldest  loud character Laurie Laurie loud is  your typical 17 year old although she  and Lenny are quite similar in age her  characters are completely different as  the oldest of the bunch  Laurie uses that power to control her  siblings and make them do whatever she  wants she's bossy and her temper is  quite similar to Lois as a big sister  she's also protective and knows when to  stand up for her younger siblings much  like Lenny Laurie has long blonde hair  she's usually seen in shorts and a tank  top and she always has a phone attached  to her hands we told you she's your  typical 17 year old it's not easy being  a big sister of that many siblings but  Laurie somehow makes it work with her  ongoing dominance as a firstborn child  really who can blame her if you're  looking for a real-life version of  Laurie  you might want to check out Emma Stone  as a blonde  doesn't she look perfect Laurie is  voiced by Catherine Taber who gave her  voice to several side cartoon characters  and we love that she's able to play the  oldest sibling of the loud family  we can't imagine what it must be like to  have a family this big but we also can't  imagine what it must be like to be our  next character who has a huge crush on  Laurie  Clyde we've shown you 9 out of 11  characters from the loud family with the  loud siblings also have best friends and  one of them is Clyde who hangs out with  Lincoln as an only child Clyde's  extremely jealous of Lincoln's large  family and as we mentioned he's an  uncontrollable crush on Laurie who  unfortunately has a boyfriend  even though Clyde is just 11 years old  he's incredibly romantic and wants to  treat Laurie like the princess she is at  the same time  Clyde loves to hang out with his best  friend play video games and read comics  Clyde's obsession with Laurie reminds us  of Helga's obsession with Arnold in Hey  Arnold it makes us wonder if he'll ever  succeed in his mission to make Laurie  his girlfriend  Clyde sports an afro haircut and he's  usually seen wearing glasses a shirt  pants and trainers check out this cutie  he could easily be Clyde's real-life  twin Clyde is voiced by Kahlil Harris  who also voiced a Jay in blaze on the  monster machines we can't wait to see  what's next for this 11 year old  we really hope his dreams of making  Laurie his girlfriend comes true we're  all cheering you on Clyde are you quiet  or are you the loudest in your family  let us know in the comments for more  videos like this one check out 10 kids  who look like cartoon characters thanks  for watching  [Music]
 

